{"id":"169d038a6c234a56","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-model8-skolem-closure.md","title":"ZFC Model8 Skolem Closure","display":"df-zfc-model8-skolem-closure — ZFC Model8 Skolem Closure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model8-skolem-closure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model8-skolem-closure"],"display":"df-zfc-model8-skolem-closure — ZFC Model8 Skolem Closure","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-skolem-function]]","[[58-df-structure]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model8-skolem-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model8-skolem-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model8-skolem-closure — ZFC Model8 Skolem Closure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"91b4c987294d365f\" href=\"?note=91b4c987294d365f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-skolem-function\">58-df-zfc-skolem-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,A,M,L\\in V\">\\(H,A,M,L\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\\)</span> (结构谓词与论域投影, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 的公式 Skolem 函数关系, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"91b4c987294d365f\" href=\"?note=91b4c987294d365f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-skolem-function\">58-df-zfc-skolem-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}:V\\to V\\)</span> (函数定义域, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel8SkolemClosure}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel8SkolemClosure}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}skolem\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel8SkolemClosure}_S(H,A,M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists L\\in V\\;\\Biggl(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\n\\land A\\subseteq H\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall f,\\varphi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_S(f,M,\\varphi)\n\\to\\forall s\\in H^{&lt;\\omega}\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\;(f(s)\\in H)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall K\\in V\\;\\Biggl(\nA\\subseteq K\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\n\\land\\forall f,\\varphi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_S(f,M,\\varphi)\n\\to\\forall s\\in K^{&lt;\\omega}\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\;(f(s)\\in K)\\Bigr)\n\\to H\\subseteq K\\Biggr)\\Biggr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}skolem\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel8SkolemClosure}_S(H,A,M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists L\\in V\\;\\Biggl(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\n\\land A\\subseteq H\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall f,\\varphi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_S(f,M,\\varphi)\n\\to\\forall s\\in H^{&lt;\\omega}\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\;(f(s)\\in H)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall K\\in V\\;\\Biggl(\nA\\subseteq K\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\n\\land\\forall f,\\varphi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{SkolemFunction}_S(f,M,\\varphi)\n\\to\\forall s\\in K^{&lt;\\omega}\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\;(f(s)\\in K)\\Bigr)\n\\to H\\subseteq K\\Biggr)\\Biggr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>闭包条件直接量化上游三元 Skolem-function 关系，并在函数图的实际定义域内量化有限元组；不再使用无来源的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sk}(M)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sk}(M)\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{arity}(f)\">\\(\\operatorname{arity}(f)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-skolem-function","status":"resolved","id":"91b4c987294d365f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-skolem-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-structure]]","embed":false},